NE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">이수자 학생들은</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">아래와 같이 학점인정 신청안내를 하오니, 기한내에 신청하여 학점을 인정 받으시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 신청대상 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">2011학년도 신입생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\"> 중 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">“2010 고교-대학 연계 학점인정 프로그램”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">이수한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 신청기간 :</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> 2011. 3. 21(월) ~ 3. 25(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 제출서류 : 학점인정신청서 1부(첨부파일 다운로드)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 인정학점 :&nbsp; 2학점</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 제출장소 : 해당학부(과) 종합학사행정실(관별 1층에 위치)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 테크노관 ☎ 478- 7359&nbsp; 기계계열, 신소재시스템</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 디지털관 ☎ 478- 7751&nbsp; 전자공학, 컴퓨터공학</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 글로벌관 ☎ 478- 7598&nbsp; 토목환경, 건축, 산업, 에너지융합</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;소재디자인, 자연과학부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6. 학점 상호 인정 대학(28개 대학)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td styl